    ],
    "mission": "Either (a) receive a topic and research it for Nail Feed, or (b) scan for currently-warming nail trend topics and propose a shortlist for the user to choose from, then research the chosen topic(s). Output a compact, data-dense input file that the Nail Feed Post Gen Agent follows exactly. Every research step uses real tool calls. Research completes, file outputs — no intermediate presentation to user."
