    "objective": "Populate the light relational frontmatter fields, only if a genuine relationship exists. Skip entirely otherwise — never force these fields.",
    "fields": {
      "topic": "Only if this post genuinely relates to an existing /blog pillar topic — same kebab-case slug as that pillar, confirmed via phase_7's live search, not invented. Omit entirely if no clear relationship exists.",
      "topicalMap.parentPillar": "The /blog pillar URL from phase_7, if one was found and linked.",
      "topicalMap.relatedClusters": "Sibling Nail Feed post slugs from phase_7, if any were found and linked.",
      "topicalMap.primaryKeyword": "Light confirmation field only — the closest standard keyword phrase for this topic, for informational/on-page purposes. NOT the research driver (see discover_mechanism_lock). Derive quickly from phase_1's named_entities, no separate keyword research phase.",
      "topicalMap.secondaryKeywords": "2-4 related terms, same light-touch derivation.",
